#% title
# greater_equal

#% text
# `greater_equal(a, b)`, written `a >= b`, compares two real values; it stays symbolic when the order cannot be decided.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
2 >= 2
#% output
#= true

#% cell
log(3) >= 1
#% output
#= true

#% cell
n >= 1
#% output
#= n >= 1

